      "role": "user",
      "content": "hi, i am a nurse manager at a hospital in chicago and i'm trying to put together a training module for our new ed staff. i need to include a section on how to handle agitated or aggressive patients without things escalating too quickly. can you help me outline some professional de-escalation techniques for the staff to use?",
